                                                "sense_id": "ec519822-c379-333b-ad0b-679b2b8d0953",
                                                "text": "Not so much wedded as welded to their airline seats, he and his amanuensis see the cities of the future as ‘glocal’ phenomena, where high-density urban centres are air-linked to intercontinental faubourgs."
